WEBVTT

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:04.990
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:07.910
"Be strong and sad!"

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:11.780
Just a little more, just a little bit more.

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:16.300
Raise your hands!

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:27.180
I'm sure you won't realize it,

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:31.110
But you're the same as you always were.

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:35.840
You smiled at me.

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:41.940
Like a leaf swaying in the wind,

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:48.790
It seems like my heart is going to explode.

00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:53.630
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:56.580
"Be strong and be sad!"

00:00:57.070 --> 00:01:00.560
Just a little more, just a little bit more.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:04.480
Raise your hands!

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:09.250
Someday, you will be gentle,

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:12.350
And understand what I am saying to you!

00:01:12.670 --> 00:01:16.210
It'll be all right, no matter where you go,

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:20.720
This excitement will never stop!

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:36.990
Tsumugino High School Graduation Ceremony

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:44.830
Now then, to continue, the Director, Bakuretsudan-sensei, will say a few congratulatory words.

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:44.830
TL note: "Bakuretsudan" means "bomb."

00:01:41.990 --> 00:01:45.040
Tsumugino High School Graduation Certificate Ceremony

00:01:58.630 --> 00:02:02.760
You will be graduating from our school today.

00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:05.930
You will be setting forth on your new lives.

00:02:07.690 --> 00:02:12.690
There are many paths that lie before you.

00:02:13.860 --> 00:02:17.990
However, those paths will not be easy.

00:02:19.070 --> 00:02:24.450
You will be beset by harsh storms, and you may lose your way.

00:02:25.910 --> 00:02:27.960
However! You will be fine.

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:30.750
No storm can last forever.

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:39.680
Even if your heart is broken, and you nearly lose your way, you should never forget this.

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:44.720
You will always have the friends you made at this school.

00:02:45.770 --> 00:02:47.980
You will have priceless friends with you.

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:51.400
When you're having a hard time,
believe that your hearts will be as one.

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:53.650
Overcome that hardship.

00:02:56.070 --> 00:02:58.280
Congratulations on graduating.

00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:01.320
YAY!

00:03:01.610 --> 00:03:04.450
Sign says: Tsumugino High School Graduation Certificate Ceremony.

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:20.970
An Exciting Wish

00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:22.890
Senpai! Don't leave us!

00:03:22.890 --> 00:03:24.970
Kamino-san! I... I...

00:03:25.350 --> 00:03:27.810
Thank you, Tokimeki Memorial.

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:32.730
Whoa! I'm so touched!

00:03:32.730 --> 00:03:34.610
SENPAI!

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:37.020
This'll be my last spurt!

00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:37.980
50,000 laps!

00:03:37.980 --> 00:03:39.570
YEAH!

00:03:40.030 --> 00:03:41.280
Ishiuchi-san.

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:44.950
Captain! Thank you so much for everything you've done!

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:48.830
Senpai! We'll never forget you!

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:52.750
Geez. It's nothing to cry about.

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:54.080
You're pathetic.

00:03:59.210 --> 00:04:00.010
Tsukasa.

00:04:00.010 --> 00:04:01.510
Yes, Captain?

00:04:01.510 --> 00:04:03.930
Um... Congratulations on graduating.

00:04:05.430 --> 00:04:07.180
Never mind. Just go.

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:09.720
Right!

00:04:18.480 --> 00:04:19.530
Yayoi-san.

00:04:20.440 --> 00:04:23.110
I hope he understands how you feel.

00:04:25.570 --> 00:04:26.780
Good luck.

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:31.370
Right!

00:04:36.670 --> 00:04:38.040
It's all over now.

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:43.470
Thanks for everything you've done over the past year.

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:46.970
Farewell.

00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:50.100
AOBA!

00:04:51.560 --> 00:04:52.180
Riku!

00:04:53.270 --> 00:04:54.350
His locker's empty.

00:04:54.350 --> 00:04:55.190
No way. He's left already?

00:04:56.980 --> 00:04:58.110
Aoba.

00:04:58.940 --> 00:05:00.690
Riku-kun. Why didn't you tell us?

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:03.150
Has Aoba-kun already left?

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:04.820
Probably.

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:06.700
He didn't even say goodbye.

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:13.620
That asshole!

00:05:13.950 --> 00:05:15.120
Aoba.

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:19.130
He might still be nearby.

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:19.960
Let's go look for him!

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:21.500
Okay, everyone!

00:05:21.710 --> 00:05:23.710
Let's go look for Aoba!

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:24.880
YEAH!

00:05:57.080 --> 00:05:58.120
What'll I do?

00:05:58.370 --> 00:05:59.830
My heart won't stop pounding.

00:06:01.790 --> 00:06:02.800
Riku-kun.

00:06:10.090 --> 00:06:13.100
Sign says: Offerings.

00:06:46.630 --> 00:06:50.590
I WON'T leave things like this.

00:06:58.510 --> 00:07:01.470
This is... This is... nothing. This feeling will soon pass.

00:07:01.690 --> 00:07:02.610
Hiyoko-kun.

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:03.980
I should get going.

00:07:05.060 --> 00:07:05.720
I see.

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:06.980
See ya.

00:07:26.340 --> 00:07:27.670
Hey, Amamiya-kun.

00:07:28.010 --> 00:07:29.380
So, what are you gonna do?

00:07:30.220 --> 00:07:31.260
Have you made up your mind?

00:07:31.550 --> 00:07:33.220
Won't you tell me your decision?

00:07:35.140 --> 00:07:35.890
Sakurai-kun.

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:39.220
I...

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:44.610
Well, shall we get started?

00:07:46.520 --> 00:07:47.230
Yes.

00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:02.250
Hurry up, Riku-kun.

00:08:09.090 --> 00:08:09.880
Kasuga-san.

00:08:33.240 --> 00:08:34.740
Tokimeki Memorial.

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:35.780
Only Love.

00:08:37.280 --> 00:08:40.450
Sign says: Offerings.

00:08:54.220 --> 00:08:55.550
It's all right like this, isn't it?

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:29.750
"Goodbye Aoba Riku-kun" Event Program

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:33.760
Emergency Contact Details

00:09:32.760 --> 00:09:33.760
All Students

00:09:32.760 --> 00:09:33.760
Are you sure?                 Yes. No.

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:35.760
Sending messages...

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:35.760
Mail

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:53.400
I couldn't say anything to Amamiya-san.

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:00.530
What's this?

00:10:00.530 --> 00:10:01.490
A message from the Student Council?

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:02.620
Emergency
Student Council Message

00:10:02.490 --> 00:10:03.740
We will now begin a Goodbye Event for class A's Aoba Riku-kun, who is transferring today!

00:10:03.740 --> 00:10:09.960
"We will now begin a Goodbye Event for class A's Aoba Riku-kun, who is transferring today"?

00:10:09.960 --> 00:10:11.130
The prize is...

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:13.420
Amamiya Sayuri's...

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:16.380
Handmade chocolate?!

00:10:18.970 --> 00:10:19.720
There.

00:10:33.150 --> 00:10:34.270
Aoba-kun!

00:10:36.440 --> 00:10:38.990
Can you hear me, Aoba-kun?

00:10:44.700 --> 00:10:49.210
Please. I'm begging you.

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:56.170
Don't leave us yet!

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:01.470
Sakurai-kun!

00:11:01.470 --> 00:11:03.100
What do you think you're doing?

00:11:03.100 --> 00:11:04.470
As the vice-principal...

00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:08.140
You're not allowed to hold any events on the day of the graduation ceremony.

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:10.810
Um... Well... Please let me explain.

00:11:10.810 --> 00:11:12.480
This is, well...

00:11:12.730 --> 00:11:14.060
What's wrong? Please calm yourself.

00:11:14.860 --> 00:11:17.150
I have some good medicine for your ailment. Take it.

00:11:17.940 --> 00:11:19.820
Amamiya-san! What's wrong?

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:21.820
Cancel the event at once!

00:11:27.790 --> 00:11:30.330
Well, this is...

00:11:52.310 --> 00:11:54.270
Amamiya Sayuri's chocolate!

00:11:54.270 --> 00:11:55.610
I'm gonna get it!

00:12:00.650 --> 00:12:01.650
Amamiya-san.

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:07.990
We've been waiting for you, Aoba-kun!

00:12:09.410 --> 00:12:15.500
This will be our final battle. This is an exciting event set up by the Student Council.

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:17.670
Bring it on, Aoba-kun!

00:12:17.790 --> 00:12:20.670
If you wish to pass, you'll have to get through us!

00:12:21.590 --> 00:12:22.470
Amamiya-san.

00:12:56.960 --> 00:12:58.250
HOLD IT!

00:13:19.940 --> 00:13:21.690
This is it, Aoba-kun.

00:13:21.690 --> 00:13:22.900
Too bad.

00:13:24.430 --> 00:13:25.640
Do it now!

00:13:26.750 --> 00:13:30.590
Final Move: Kinchakorato!

00:13:31.490 --> 00:13:32.490
Hiyoko-kun!

00:13:47.450 --> 00:13:49.920
Doujima!

00:13:55.310 --> 00:13:56.230
Aoba.

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:57.350
You're so cold-hearted.

00:13:57.890 --> 00:14:00.520
Call me if you need help.

00:14:01.230 --> 00:14:02.480
We're your best friends.

00:14:02.350 --> 00:14:03.070
Go now Riku!

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:04.070
Right!

00:14:07.030 --> 00:14:09.200
Okay. Let's stop anyone who comes close!

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:11.330
Take care of Amamiya for us.

00:14:11.330 --> 00:14:13.910
Onee-san! Do we have enough ammo?

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:15.200
No problem!

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:18.460
I was paid in advance.

00:14:18.460 --> 00:14:21.710
I got these from the military. Please use as many bullets as you like!

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:24.130
We'll create a path for Riku-kun.

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:25.760
Aoba's our best friend!

00:14:25.920 --> 00:14:26.970
From now on...

00:14:26.780 --> 00:14:28.500
Come on guyz, Eastward Advance!!

00:14:32.350 --> 00:14:36.140
They're blazing a trail for their friend.

00:14:36.520 --> 00:14:38.730
It is truly beautiful.

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:03.750
You jerk! Riku-kun, you jerk!

00:15:04.210 --> 00:15:07.050
It was my destiny. My heart was pounding, but...

00:15:09.130 --> 00:15:10.220
I don't want this.

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:12.720
I don't want you to go away.

00:15:13.850 --> 00:15:15.850
I don't want to be separated from you.

00:15:21.310 --> 00:15:22.770
Now, now, Tsukasa.

00:15:22.770 --> 00:15:23.860
Stop crying.

00:15:24.310 --> 00:15:25.020
But...

00:15:25.020 --> 00:15:26.020
But...

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:30.650
You won't be a good captain if you act like this in front of your kouhai.

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:30.650
TL note: A kouhai is the opposite of a senpai.

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:41.370
Captain!

00:15:54.510 --> 00:15:59.520
I pray that Riku-san can be happy.

00:16:05.900 --> 00:16:10.190
Riku-san. Thank you for giving me courage.

00:16:39.760 --> 00:16:40.930
Amamiya-san.

00:16:40.930 --> 00:16:41.980
I-I...

00:16:50.070 --> 00:16:50.820
I...

00:16:52.110 --> 00:16:54.450
I... What's wrong with me?

00:16:54.740 --> 00:16:57.370
I don't understand why I feel this way.

00:16:57.870 --> 00:16:59.700
Why do I feel like this when I'm with you?

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:01.370
I don't know what to do.

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:06.290
When I see you getting along so well with other people, I get upset.

00:17:07.130 --> 00:17:09.750
I get angry, and I treat others so coldly.

00:17:12.210 --> 00:17:13.090
Amamiya-san.

00:17:16.340 --> 00:17:17.090
Aoba-kun.

00:17:17.510 --> 00:17:21.220
I'm sure you're gonna hate me. You'll hate me.

00:17:21.600 --> 00:17:24.850
I get depressed when I think about that, and I become so hesitant.

00:17:25.390 --> 00:17:27.310
But I can't help it.

00:17:27.770 --> 00:17:32.570
When I think about you, Aoba-kun, I lose my mind.

00:17:33.440 --> 00:17:39.450
But... But you know, I was so sad when I heard that you were going away.

00:17:39.820 --> 00:17:42.080
My heart ached.

00:17:42.490 --> 00:17:45.080
It's as though my heart was being crushed in a vice.

00:17:47.210 --> 00:17:49.210
I finally understand how I feel about you.

00:17:49.920 --> 00:17:51.960
I finally understand why my heart aches.

00:17:53.000 --> 00:17:55.970
I finally realize how I feel about you.

00:17:58.470 --> 00:18:06.140
To be honest, I have a short fuse, I'm jealous, I'm a coward, and I shout at others very easily.

00:18:06.730 --> 00:18:09.480
I'm not honest like Kasuga-san and Yayoi-san.

00:18:10.110 --> 00:18:11.650
I'm not cute at all.

00:18:13.900 --> 00:18:18.070
But you always stood by me all this time.

00:18:18.780 --> 00:18:23.370
No. To be honest, I thought that you might be disgusted with me.

00:18:23.740 --> 00:18:28.500
But I could show my true colors when I was with you.

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:32.380
You were always smiling when you were with me.

00:18:32.960 --> 00:18:36.880
You're the only one who ever saw me for who I was.

00:18:38.430 --> 00:18:42.550
When I was with you, Aoba-kun, I didn't have to pretend to be someone else.

00:18:43.010 --> 00:18:43.890
That's why...

00:18:44.600 --> 00:18:45.390
That's why I...

00:18:58.240 --> 00:18:59.860
Do you accept me for who I am?

00:19:00.740 --> 00:19:06.160
As a coward, a jealous, spiteful girl, a girl with a short fuse?

00:19:06.660 --> 00:19:08.460
Is it all right for me to love you?

00:19:13.500 --> 00:19:17.090
I hurt Kasuga-san in the same way.

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:19.590
So I have no right to...

00:19:19.590 --> 00:19:20.430
Aoba.

00:19:24.640 --> 00:19:26.260
Don't run away from yourself.

00:19:35.270 --> 00:19:36.650
Geez. Amamiya-san.

00:19:44.780 --> 00:19:46.910
Will you tell me your e-mail address this time?

00:19:51.830 --> 00:19:52.920
Y-Yes!

00:19:53.420 --> 00:19:55.920
YAY!

00:19:56.250 --> 00:19:58.090
Dammit, Aoba!

00:19:58.090 --> 00:19:59.920
Congratulations, you lucky bastard!

00:20:00.260 --> 00:20:01.300
D-Dammit!

00:20:01.300 --> 00:20:02.090
Lucky you!

00:20:02.090 --> 00:20:03.430
Amamiya-san!

00:20:03.430 --> 00:20:04.760
I love you!

00:20:07.970 --> 00:20:10.230
I'm moved to tears.

00:20:10.230 --> 00:20:12.100
I can't believe he got Amamiya-san.

00:20:12.100 --> 00:20:13.060
It's beyond my expectations.

00:20:13.060 --> 00:20:15.900
Geez. Everyone's different.

00:20:24.610 --> 00:20:26.050
Everyone wishes for your happiness, Riku.

00:20:26.320 --> 00:20:29.660
Thank you very much for buying so much today.

00:20:29.870 --> 00:20:32.040
Mortars says: Shooting Stars. 100 Raging Fireworks. 100 Raging Fireworks. Shooting Stars.

00:20:30.330 --> 00:20:31.710
This is a free gift!

00:20:32.250 --> 00:20:33.870
Whoa!

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:36.130
Let's try them out.

00:20:36.130 --> 00:20:36.920
Yeah!

00:20:37.040 --> 00:20:43.050
Amamiya-san. It's me, Sakurai.
I have an interesting suggestion about
Aoba-kun's event. Won't you listen to me?

00:20:37.290 --> 00:20:37.630
Functions.

00:20:46.220 --> 00:20:48.350
It looks you'll get away with it.

00:20:48.720 --> 00:20:52.890
The Director let us get away with it because everyone was enjoying it.

00:20:53.100 --> 00:20:53.940
Or so I heard.

00:20:54.810 --> 00:20:56.020
Hey, Sakurai-kun.

00:20:56.020 --> 00:20:57.360
Isn't it a relief?

00:20:57.770 --> 00:21:00.230
We've witnessed the birth of a new legend.

00:21:00.690 --> 00:21:01.400
Isn't that enough?

00:21:01.740 --> 00:21:03.190
You're so dishonest.

00:21:10.330 --> 00:21:11.660
Wh-Whoa!

00:21:12.080 --> 00:21:14.830
Fireworks in the spring night sky!

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:17.040
This is what it means to be young!

00:22:02.340 --> 00:22:04.170
Hey, have you heard about that tree?

00:22:04.170 --> 00:22:05.670
That's the Legendary Tree.

00:22:06.220 --> 00:22:07.510
It's said that on the day of the graduation ceremony,

00:22:07.510 --> 00:22:09.760
if a couple declares their love for each other under that tree,

00:22:09.760 --> 00:22:12.060
they will always be happy.

00:22:12.470 --> 00:22:14.270
I wonder if that's true.

00:22:14.810 --> 00:22:15.810
Oh.

00:22:31.490 --> 00:22:32.490
Aoba-kun.

00:22:38.000 --> 00:22:40.960
Everything that begins will end someday.

00:22:41.540 --> 00:22:44.750
Greetings will result in partings someday.

00:22:45.800 --> 00:22:48.010
If relationships continued forever,

00:22:46.420 --> 00:22:51.340
Magazine title: Maid School.

00:22:48.510 --> 00:22:50.840
I wonder how happy we would be.

00:22:51.680 --> 00:22:53.720
That is how those who wish for it feel.

00:22:54.350 --> 00:22:57.140
Those feelings come together and create a legend.

00:22:57.390 --> 00:22:59.100
Those legends are passed down to future generations.

00:23:00.350 --> 00:23:03.150
Some places call it a "Legendary Tree."

00:23:04.020 --> 00:23:07.940
And in other places, they call it a "Legendary Bell."

00:23:07.150 --> 00:23:08.440
Sign says: Yakisoba Bread.

00:23:08.570 --> 00:23:10.240
Or a "Legendary Hill."

00:23:11.070 --> 00:23:19.790
And at our school, Tsumugino High school, that's what it's been called, ever since the graduation ceremony.

00:23:21.080 --> 00:23:24.920
It will connect our feelings, even if we're separated.

00:23:25.210 --> 00:23:26.460
The Tree of Our Wish.

00:23:27.300 --> 00:23:31.050
As long as I'm here, I feel that those
who are important to me are with me.

00:23:32.140 --> 00:23:38.640
Even if there's only a slim chance that
we'll meet again, I feel like we're connected.

00:23:43.030 --> 00:23:45.860
I love you.

00:24:34.120 --> 00:24:39.180
Thanks for watching!
